	(text "Higher limits require source permission. R28 alone: <500mA; R28 || R29: <1.5A (resistor tolerance included).\nSuspend: disable charging and meet the bus power budget. Isolate USB only with a usable battery.\nFirmware, no-battery suspend, attach and inrush validation remain pending."
